# Files executed or parsed inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings,
# even on Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF shebang line makes
# /bin/sh fail with "not found" (e.g. the Nginx entrypoint).
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
Dockerfile.*    text eol=lf
*.dockerfile    text eol=lf
